<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to Tabaany</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: #fffbea;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            color: #111111;
        }
        .wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 24px 12px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .card {
            max-width: 620px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #111111;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14);
        }
        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #111111 0%, #2a2a2a 40%, #facc15 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 36px 24px 30px;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 30px;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }
        .hero p {
            margin: 10px 0 0;
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #fef08a;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 30px 28px;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #1f1f1f;
        }
        .intro {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #111111;
            margin: 0 0 14px;
        }
        .feature-box {
            margin: 20px 0 22px;
            background: #fff7cc;
            border: 1px solid #facc15;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 16px 18px;
        }
        .feature-box h2 {
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #111111;
        }
        .feature-box ul {
            margin: 0;
            padding-left: 18px;
        }
        .feature-box li {
            margin: 6px 0;
        }
        .cta-wrap {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 24px 0 12px;
        }
        .cta {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #111111;
            color: #facc15;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 14px;
            border: 1px solid #facc15;
        }
        .footer {
            border-top: 1px solid #111111;
            background: #111111;
            text-align: center;
            color: #facc15;
            font-size: 12px;
            padding: 18px 20px 24px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 24px;
            }
            .content {
                padding: 24px 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="hero">
                <h1>Welcome to Tabaany</h1>
                <p>Your next adventure starts now.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="content">
                <p class="intro">Hi {{ prenom }},</p>
                <p>
                    Thanks for signing up. Your account is now active and ready to use.
                    We are excited to help you discover destinations, plan experiences, and travel smarter.
                </p>

                <div class="feature-box">
                    <h2>What you can do now</h2>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Find inspiring travel destinations</li>
                        <li>Save and manage your travel preferences</li>
                        <li>Plan your next trip in minutes</li>
                        <li>Access exclusive offers and updates</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>


                <p>If you need help, simply contact our support team and we will be happy to assist you.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="footer">
                <div>&copy; {{ "now"|date("Y") }} Tabaany. All rights reserved.</div>
                <div>This is an automated email. Please do not reply directly to this message.</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
